hess Puzzles: The Comprehensive Guide to Effective Problem Solving”, in Next Level Chess:","type":"quotation","bold_text_offsets":[[47,48],[107,108]],"id":"3a629a2e-8840-449f-a90c-e86e013df6ef"}],"topics":["board-games","card-games","chess","games"],"categories":["English abbreviations","English terms with quotations","en:Card games","en:Chess"],"links":[["card game","card game"],["chess","chess"],["queen","queen#English"]],"raw_glosses":["(card games, chess) Abbreviation of queen."],"glosses":["Abbreviation of queen."],"tags":["abbreviation","alt-of","countable","uncountable"],"alt_of":[{"word":"queen"}],"id":"c95d26aa-0524-4415-b67a-e933f2dad95a"},{"topics":["medicine","sciences"],"categories":["en:Medicine"],"links":[["medicine","medicine"],["q","q#English:_every"]],"raw_glosses":["(medicine) Alternative letter-case form of q (“every”)."],"glosses":["Alternative letter-case form of q (“every”)."],"tags":["alt-of","countable","uncountable"],"alt_of":[{"word":"q","extra":"every"}],"id":"90d87451-ff04-428c-9488-b51d348e114c"}],"related":[],"synonyms":[]}}
